new patch based on v4:
---
 drivers/usb/musb/musb_core.c | 42 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 drivers/usb/musb/musb_core.h |  5 +++++
 drivers/usb/musb/musb_host.c | 46 ++++++++++----------------------------------
 drivers/usb/musb/musb_io.h   |  4 ++++
